mond loser, "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["hs","sc"],["at","and one Club loser - one loser too many. "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["hs","ns"],["at","You can't trump any of your losers in the dummy, so you look for somewhere to discard one. There is no immediate extra winner in dummy, but if you lead toward the high card, you might be able to develop an extra winner in the Spade suit."],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["hc","dk"],["nt","\nCan you afford to draw trump first? On this deal yes, you can. You can draw trump without losing a trick and you do not need your trump for other purposes. Win the opening lead with dummy's @DK "],["pg",""],["lc","dk"],["pc","dk"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","ns"],["at","because you want to preserve entries to your hand so that you can lead toward dummy's Spades. "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["hc","hk"],["nt","\nDraw trump by leading the @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hk"],["pc","hk"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","nh"],["at","and a Heart "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["hc","ha"],["at","back to your @HA. "],["pg",""],["lc","ha"],["pc","ha"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["at","When the missing trump divides 2-2, you don't have to draw any more "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hs","ss"],["at","and you are in your hand, so that you can lead toward "],["pg",""],["ls","ss"],["pc","s"],["hs","ns"],["at","dummy's Spades. "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["hs","ws"],["nt","\nWhen West plays a small card, "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["pc","s"],["hc","sj"],["at","play dummy's @SJ "],["pg",""],["lc","sj"],["hc","sq"],["at","or @SQ. "],["pg",""],["lc","sq"],["pc","sq"],["hc","sk"],["at","East will win the @SK. "],["pg",""],["lc","sk"],["pc","sk"],["pg",""],["hs","ed"],["at","You can win East's Diamond return "],["pg",""],["ls","ed"],["pc","dq"],["hc","da"],["at","with your @DA "],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["pc","da"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","ss"],["at","and lead your remaining small Spade toward dummy. "],["pg",""],["ls","ss"],["pc","s"],["hc","sa"],["at","If West doesn't play the @SA, "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["pc","s"],["hc","sj"],["at","you will play dummy's @SJ, "],["pg",""],["lc","sj"],["pc","sj"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["at","which will win the trick. You will not lose two Spade tricks. "],["pg",""],["up","3"],["hc","sa"],["nt","\nIf West does win the @SA, "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","sj"],["at","dummy's @SJ is established as an extra winner. "],["pg",""],["lc","sj"],["hs","wd"],["at","The opponents can take a Diamond trick, but that will be their last trick. "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["pc","dt"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","wc"],["at","You can win the Club return "],["pg",""],["ls","wc"],["pc","c"],["hc","ck"],["at","with dummy's @CK "],["pg",""],["lc","ck"],["pc","ck"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","sc"],["at","and discard your Club loser "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["hc","sj"],["at","on the @SJ."],["",""]]}}